  # RELOADABLE: detachable box magazine, 32 rounds. The magazine is its own surface (surf 1, 792 tris,
  # the full box base plate to receiver with the three rounds on top), lifted out as tec9_mag.md3 and
  # proven to drop in game. The animation never reloads (the mod's Machinegun has no reload state);
